Template: betterguac/admin-email
Type: string
Default:
Description: Email address for the first BetterGuac administrator:
 BetterGuac signs people in with their email address. This creates the
 first administrator account with this email as its sign-in name.
 .
 Leave it empty to create an account named "admin" instead.

Template: betterguac/admin-password
Type: password
Description: Password for the first BetterGuac administrator:
 Leave it empty to have a strong random password generated. A generated
 password is saved in /etc/betterguac/initial-admin.txt, readable only by
 root.
